    Dispatch --> GuardRun
    RecoverLeases --> GuardChunk
    RecoverLeases --> GuardAdmission
    Finalize --> GuardRun
    Publish --> GuardOutbox
    ChunkClaim --> GuardChunk
    ChunkClaim --> GuardAdmission
    CompleteChunk --> GuardChunk
    CompleteChunk --> GuardAdmission
    Execute --> GuardRun
    Execute --> GuardAdmission
